{% extends 'emails/base.txt.twig' %}

{% block content %}
Hi{{ name ? ' ' ~ name : '' }},

Your DMARCo account was signed in to from an IP address it has not seen before.

  IP address  {{ ip ?? 'Unknown' }}
  Device      {{ userAgent ?? 'Unknown' }}
  Time        {{ occurredAt|date('Y-m-d H:i T') }}

If this was you, there is nothing to do. If it was not, set a new password on
your server right away:

docker compose exec php bin/console app:user:reset-password
{% endblock %}

{% block footer %}
You can turn these alerts off in your notification settings:
{{ frontend_url }}/notifications
{% endblock %}
